---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Aju House">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 md:py-24">
        
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Home</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <span class="text-gray-900">Terms & Conditions</span>
        </nav>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-12 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">Last Updated: July 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
            
            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">1. Overview</h2>
                <p>Welcome to <strong>Aju House</strong> (operated via <code>ajuperfumes.com</code>). Throughout the site, the terms "we", "us", and "our" refer to Aju House. By visiting our store or purchasing signature fragrances and accessories from us, you engage in our "Service" and agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">2. Online Store & Eligibility</h2>
                <p>By agreeing to these Terms of Service, you represent that you are at least the age of majority in your state or province of residence. You may not use our products for any illegal or unauthorized purpose nor may you violate any laws in your jurisdiction.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">3. Products, Pricing & Accuracy</h2>
                <p>All prices listed on <code>ajuperfumes.com</code> are in Indian Rupees (INR) and include applicable taxes unless explicitly stated otherwise. We reserve the right to modify prices, discontinue items, or update product descriptions at any time without prior notice. We make every effort to display the colors and images of our products as accurately as possible.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">4. Billing & Payment Gateway</h2>
                <p>Payments are processed securely through accredited payment aggregators (including Razorpay). You agree to provide current, complete, and accurate purchase and account information for all transactions made at our store. We do not store credit card credentials or sensitive payment tokens on our servers.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">5. Limitation of Liability & Governing Law</h2>
                <p>In no case shall Aju House, our directors, officers, or employees be liable for any injury, loss, claim, or any direct or indirect damages arising from your use of any of our products. These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India, under the jurisdiction of courts in Kerala, India.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">6. Contact Information</h2>
                <p>Questions about the Terms & Conditions should be sent to us at:</p>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-sm text-xs space-y-1 font-mono">
                    <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Aju House Client Care</p>
                    <p>Email: perfumesaju@gmail.com</p>
                    <p>WhatsApp / Call: +91 8075304432</p>
                    <p>Location: Kerala, India</p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>